  [; ── modules that LEAVE the frozen stdlib for the product that consumes them ── ]
  [; stdlib/ft.cx, spec/03-approved/stdlib/ft.md and conformance/stdlib/ft.cxd RETIRED
     (RULED: RS-12, RS-8; #1591 item K3) -- ft's CX-level surface left whole with the
     extraction of cx-platform-store; registry/modules.cxd's ft row now names
